        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Global TC4300 Door Closer Drop Plate</b>\r\n<p>\r\nFor use when mounting door closer on the <b>Pull Side</b> of a door. \r\nWhen mounting closer on the door face (Regular Arm Mounting), the minimum top rail width of door is 1-1/2\". \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/global-tc4300-parallel-mount-closer-drop-plate-global-dp-4300-18pa\"><b>Push Side Mounted Drop Plate</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/door-closer-top-jamb-mounting-plate-global-dp-4300-18tj\"><b>Top Jamb Mounted Drop Plate</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nFor use with <a href=\"/products/lcn-4040-series-replacement-ada-compliant-heavy-duty-door-closer-global-tc4300\"><b>Global Door Controls TC4300</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/lcn-4040-super-smoothee-grade-1-door-closer\"><b>LCN P4040XP</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/extra-heavy-duty-door-closer-deltana-dc40\"><b>Deltana DC40</b></a>  or any door closer with a matching \u001d mounting hole pattern (pictured below).\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/4041_closer_dimensions.gif?v=1704352994\" width=\"369\" height=\"180\" border=\"0\" alt=\"LCN 4041 Door Closer Mounting Holes\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications:</b> for Global DP-4300-18 Drop Plate\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Height: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 3/16\" </li>\r\n<li>Material: Steel </li>\r\n<li>Non-Handed, reversible for left or right hand doors. </li>\r\n<li>Packaged with installation screws</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p><b>*Sold Individually.</b></p>",
